      "id": "andrea-caldarelli",
      "wikidata": "Q1401357",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Andrea Caldarelli (born 14 February 1990) is an Italian racing driver and team owner who competes in the IMSA SportsCar Championship in GTD Pro for Pfaff Motorsports.\n\nA Lamborghini factory driver since 2017, Caldarelli is a four-time GT World Challenge champion across Europe and America, and raced in LMDh in 2024. He previously drove in Super Formula and Super GT as a Toyota/Lexus works driver. Caldarelli undertook a Formula One test in 2008 with Toyota Racing and in 2010 with Ferrari. He co-founded the FFF Racing Team in 2014.",
        "lang": "en",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Caldarelli"
      },
      "birthDate": "1990-02-14",
      "birthPlace": "Pescara, Italia",
      "nationality": "Italia",
